  "releaseNotes": "# AgentOS 2.0.0-beta.75\n\n- Leaves model-response waiting deadlines and request retries to the native\n  Codex and OpenCode Harnesses, removing earlier default relay and model-only\n  HTTP inactivity cutoffs while retaining explicit cancellation and strict\n  incomplete-response detection\n- Preserves the same Run and completed tools during native model-request\n  recovery, without replaying the whole task\n- Persists normalized model waiting and retry activity for the Web product and\n  additive TypeScript and Java SDK status fields, including refresh and\n  reconnect recovery; request diagnostics remain outside public message streams\n- Selects an available model-relay WebSocket port when a template process\n  already uses the preferred port, without terminating that unrelated process\n- Captures bounded, redacted model-relay startup diagnostics before a failed\n  execution copy is removed instead of returning an empty startup error\n- Uses Runtime `1.0.0-beta.31` for the matching Gateway and native retry bridges;\n  preserves existing configuration, conversations, attachments, Skills and\n  durable workspaces during upgrade",
